CP server that can answer natural language questions about Brazilian soccer\\n13: - **Integration**: MCP server connected to an LLM for query processing\\n14: \\n15: ---\\n16: \\n17: ## Provided Data\\n18: \\n19: The following datasets are included in `data/kaggle/` and must be used:\\n20: \\n21: ### Match Data\\n22: \\n23: #### 1. Brasileirão Serie A Matches\\n24: **File**: `Brasileirao_Matches.csv` (4,180 matches)\\n25: **Source**: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ricardomattos05/jogos-do-campeonato-brasileiro\\n26: **License**: CC BY 4.0\\n27: \\n28: | Column | Description |\\n29: |--------|-------------|\\n30: | datetime | Match date and time |\\n31: | home_team | Home team name with state suffix (e.g., \\\"Palmeiras-SP\\\") |\\n32: | home_team_state | State abbreviation |\\n33: | away_team | Away team name with state suffix |\\n34: | away_team_state | State abbreviation |\\n35: | home_goal | Goals scored by home team |\\n36: | away_goal | Goals scored by away team |\\n37: | season | Year of the season |\\n38: | round | Match round number |\\n39: \\n40: #### 2. Copa do Brasil Matches\\n41: **File**: `Brazilian_Cup_Matches.csv` (1,337 matches)\\n42: **Source**: https://www.kag... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1788373462557,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0635d6e18001QKlci0eKST8Ayz\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"3cf402e8c0f09384526fbf37d2a50d4c12e459ca\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0635d4963001qbO1E2sx2wp8HT\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":12889,\"input\":949,\"output\":20,\"reasoning\":16,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":11904}},\"cost\":0.0033258828}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1788373463340,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0635d7126001YdJMsvNyY0izEQ\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0635d6e620010aTEce8hlQtEwJ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1\",\"snapshot\":\"