n LLM for query processing\\n14: \\n15: ---\\n16: \\n17: ## Provided Data\\n18: \\n19: The following datasets are included in `data/kaggle/` and must be used:\\n20: \\n21: ### Match Data\\n22: \\n23: #### 1. Brasileirão Serie A Matches\\n24: **File**: `Brasileirao_Matches.csv` (4,180 matches)\\n25: **Source**: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ricardomattos05/jogos-do-campeonato-brasileiro\\n26: **License**: CC BY 4.0\\n27: \\n28: | Column | Description |\\n29: |--------|-------------|\\n30: | datetime | Match date and time |\\n31: | home_team | Home team name with state suffix (e.g., \\\"Palmeiras-SP\\\") |\\n32: | home_team_state | State abbreviation |\\n33: | away_team | Away team name with state suffix |\\n34: | away_team_state | State abbreviation |\\n35: | home_goal | Goals scored by home team |\\n36: | away_goal | Goals scored by away team |\\n37: | season | Year of the season |\\n38: | round | Match round number |\\n39: \\n40: #### 2. Copa do Brasil Matches\\n41: **File**: `Brazilian_Cup_Matches.csv` (1,337 matches)\\n42: **Source**: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ricardomattos05/jogos-do-ca... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1788373448882,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0635d38a9001Xjj0NJFIP1IlPD\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"14c1755aa4c4ab6d9a91f46d1f57c7ff8c9d9663\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0635d305d001uXevPSYHLwiPqc\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":7095,\"input\":344,\"output\":14,\"reasoning\":17,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":6720}},\"cost\":0.001724724}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1788373449659,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0635d3bb2001dj0PA3jqgNZZV8\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0635d3919001DZF7yO1hqRHVfx\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1\",\"snapshot\":\"3e5fa2cf735594792475d056f5cc54362ba06622\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"too