{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788374574746,"sessionID":"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call-d54c56bc-d92d-4a87-aac7-dfc58d0bf8a3","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"\"\"\"Shared pytest fixtures for the Brazilian Soccer MCP test suite.\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport pytest\n\nfrom brsl.knowledge_graph import KnowledgeGraph\nfrom brsl.query_engine import QueryEngine\nfrom brsl import data_loader as dl\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"session\")\ndef matches_df() -> \"object\":\n    return dl.load_matches()\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"session\")\ndef deduped_df():\n    return dl.load_matches_deduplicated()\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"session\")\ndef players_df():\n    return dl.load_players()\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"session\")\ndef graph() -> KnowledgeGraph:\n    return KnowledgeGraph.load()\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"session\")\ndef engine(graph: KnowledgeGraph) -> QueryEngine:\n    return QueryEngine(graph)\n","filePath":"/workspace/tests/conftest.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/tests/conftest.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tests/conftest.py","time":{"start":1788374574732,"end":1788374574742}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"The MCP server works perfectly. 18 tools registered, champion tool returns Flamengo-RJ 90 pts. Now let me write the BDD GWT-structured pytest tests. I'll organize into multiple test files covering each capability. I'll use the Given/When/Then style with descriptive docstrings and fixtures.\n\nLet me create tests/__init__.py and the test files. I'll use a shared fixture for the engine.\n\nTest files:\n- tests/conftest.py - fixtures\n- tests/test_normalization.py\n- tests/test_data_loading.py (all 6 files loadable)\n- tests/test_match_queries.py (Given match data loaded, When search..., Then ...)\n- tests/test_team_queries.py\n- tests/test_player_queries.py\n- tests/test_competition_queries.py\n- tests/test_statistics.py\n- tests/test_derbies.py\n- tests/test_head_to_head.py\n- tests/test_mcp_server.py (build server, tools listed, call_tool works)\n\nI'll write BDD-style with docstrings explaining the scenario and GWT comments. Let me write them with actual assertions on real computed values (champion 2019 = Flamengo, etc.) plus structural assertions (each match has date, scores, competition per the gherkin scenario).\n\nLet me create conftest first.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0636e61bf001iExU7Eq7aWzYch","sessionID":"ses_f9ca2d3d8ffe7GbwdSu72bCYg1","messageID":"msg_0636e4d0b001a7rgYoH842m5Um"}}
